#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kontact; Main Window"
msgstr "A xanela principal do &kontact;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The main window consists of a side pane on the left showing the icons of "
#| "the available components, the main view on the right which contains the "
#| "main window of the active component and the usual menu, tool and status "
#| "bars."
msgid ""
"The Main Window consists of a side pane on the left showing the icons of the "
"available components, a main view on the right which contains the main "
"window of the active component and the usual menu, tool and status bars."
msgstr ""
"A xanela principal consiste nunha área lateral á esquerda que mostra as "
"iconas dos componentes disponíbeis, a vista principal á dereita, que contén "
"a xanela principal do componente activo e os barras de menú, ferramentas e "
"estado habituais."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "Side Pane"
msgstr "Área lateral"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The side pane serves multiple purposes. It allows for switching between "
#| "components, shows which component is active and serves as the target for "
#| "drag &amp; drop operations to the different applications."
msgid ""
"The Side Pane serves multiple purposes. It allows for switching between "
"components, shows which component is active and serves as the target for "
"drag &amp; drop operations to the different applications."
msgstr ""
"A área lateral cumpre varios propósitos. Permite mudar de componente, "
"mostrar que componente está activo e sirve como destinno das operacións de "
"arrastrar e soltar entre as diferentes aplicacións."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kontact;'s Side Pane</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Área lateral do &kontact;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kontact;'s Side Pane</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Área lateral do &kontact;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&kontact;'s Side Pane</para>"
msgstr "<para>Área lateral do &kontact;</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For switching between components simply click on the corresponding icon. "
#| "The main window of the component is shown and the menu, tool and status "
#| "bars are adapted to reflect the functionality of the active component. If "
#| "you activate a component for the first time there might be a small delay "
#| "until the main view is changed, because components are loaded on demand. "
#| "This means you don't waste memory for components you don't use."
msgid ""
"For switching between components simply click on the corresponding icon. The "
"main window of the component is shown and the menu, tool and status bars are "
"adapted to reflect the functionality of the active component. If you "
"activate a component for the first time there might be a small delay until "
"the main view is changed, because components are loaded on demand. This "
"means you don't waste memory for components not in use."
msgstr ""
"Para mudar de componente, simplemente prema a icona correspondente. Aparece "
"a xanela principal do componente e as barras de menú, ferramentas e estado "
"adáptanse para reflectir a funcionalidade do componente activo. Se activa o "
"componente pola primeira vez, pode notar unha pequena demora até que se "
"mostre a vista principal, dado que os componentes cárganse a pedido. Isto "
"significa que non se gasta memoria nos componentes que non use."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The icons in the side pane can also be used as targets for drag &amp; "
#| "drop operations. For example, you can drag a mail from the mail part and "
#| "drop it on the icon of the to-do list or the calendar to create a to-do "
#| "or event associated with this mail."
msgid ""
"The icons in the Side Pane can also be used as targets for drag &amp; drop "
"operations. For example, you can drag a mail message from the mail part and "
"drop it on the icon of the to-do list or the calendar to create a to-do or "
"event associated with this mail."
msgstr ""
"As iconas da área lateral tamén se poden empregar como destinos das "
"operacións de arrastrar e soltar. Pode, por exemplo, arrastrar unha mensaxe "
"de correo desde a parte do correo e soltala sobre a icona da lista de "
"tarefas ou o calendario para crear unha tarefa ou un evento asociado con esa "
"mensaxe."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:183
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Finally, you can change the size of the icons in the side pane. Right-"
#| "clicking on the side pane will give you the option to use Large, Normal, "
#| "or Small icons, as well as the option to use text only instead of icons."
msgid ""
"Finally, you can change the size of the icons in the Side Pane. Right-"
"clicking on the Side Pane will give you the option to use Large, Normal, or "
"Small icons, as well as the option to use text only instead of icons."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, pode alterar o tamñao das iconas na área lateral. Calque co "
"botón dereito do rato na área lateral e terá a opción de empregar iconas "
"grandes, normais ou pequenas, así como a opción de empregar só texto no "
"canto de iconas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you dislike the sidebar, you can simply hide it by dragging the "
#| "splitter. An alternative navigation between parts is provided by the "
#| "<guilabel>Navigator</guilabel> toolbar, which can be freely positioned. "
#| "See <xref linkend=\"bars\"/> for more on the <guilabel>Navigator</"
#| "guilabel> toolbar."
msgid ""
"If you dislike the Side Pane, you can simply hide it by dragging the "
"splitter. An alternative navigation between parts is provided by the "
"<guilabel>Navigator</guilabel> toolbar, which can be freely positioned. See "
"<xref linkend=\"bars\"/> for more on the <guilabel>Navigator</guilabel> "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Se non lle gusta a barra lateral, pode simplemente agochala arrastrando a "
"barra separadora. Dispón de navegación alternativa entre as partes mediante "
"a barra de tarefas <guilabel>Navegador</guilabel>, que se pode colocar en "
"calquer lado. Vexa <xref linkend=\"bars\"/> para máis información sobre a "
"barra de ferramentas <guilabel>Navegador</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main View"
msgstr "Vista principal"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The view on the right which takes up most of the area of the &kontact; "
#| "main window shows the active component. This exactly corresponds to the "
#| "main window the component uses when run as a stand-alone application. The "
#| "highlighted icon in the side pane indicates to which application the main "
#| "view belongs. &kontact; remembers which component was active, so when "
#| "starting &kontact; the view initially shows which one was activated when "
#| "exiting &kontact; the last time."
msgid ""
"The view on the right which takes up most of the area of the &kontact; main "
"window shows the active component. This exactly corresponds to the main "
"window the component uses when run as a stand-alone application. The "
"highlighted icon in the Side Pane indicates to which application the Main "
"View belongs. &kontact; remembers the active component when exiting, so the "
"next time &kontact; starts it initially displays that component in the Main "
"View."
msgstr ""
"A vista da dereita, que ocupa a maior parte da área da xanela principal do "
"&kontact;, mostra o componente activo. Isto corresponde exactamente coa "
"xanela principal que o componente emprega cando se executa como aplicación "
"autónoma. A icona realzada na área lateral indica a aplicación á que "
"pertence a vista principal. O &kontact; lembra o componente que estaba "
"activo, polo que ao iniciarse o &kontact;, a vista mostra inicialmente o "
"componente que estaba activo cando se saíu do &kontact; da última vez."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kontact;'s Main View</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Vista principal do &kontact;</screeninfo>"

